	test Viewcontactroleauditentriesexecutedbyagent {
		LocalFile.KoroneikiContactRoleAPI._createContactRole(table = '''| Agent Name  | Koroneiki User                                 |
	| Description | This is the default customer role for accounts |
	| Name        | Default Account Customer Role                  |
